                                "sense_id": "30cf0171-615f-34b3-9e46-161f6023265d",
                                "text": "Sometimes this Malay, a youngish man with a most charming smile, would be deferential to Crabbe, showing great anxiety to learn; at other times he would enter the office as though, in sleep, an angel had visited him, teaching him all in painless hypnopaedia."
